From: LixNix <105106115+LixNix@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: metadata: anchor footer keys and report line_width_percent

Anchor list-parser footer regexes on '; ' so keys ending in the same name
(e.g. support_nozzle_diameter) do not match, and report a percentage
line_width as line_width_percent instead of millimetres.

Original work by @LixNix (patch 04 of the U1 2.0.0.205
nozzle-map fix), rebased onto firmware-extended without changes.

